"Instructor Luna Plim teaches Creative Power Applications at Celena North High."
"She is a short, red-headed, freckled Water Shaper."
"She loves weird powers, calls special cases odd birds, and thinks Alden might control time."
"She advises the B-List club; other clubs try to poach her."
"She wears a yellow raincoat, a bun held by pencils, and has three water balls that follow her."
